    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/63e390c735ec430c2a536b428469e9f8.avif?t=1752552667\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Ember is a top-down Rogue-like action game in a dark fantasy style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the declining city of demi-humans on the edge of the world, you, as a well-trained demi-human warrior and the last hope of the tribe and the city-state, embark on an adventure to find and save the city-state and the tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.poster.avif?t=1752552667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.webm?t=1752552667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.mp4?t=1752552667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players of different professions in the game will have completely different fighting styles, and each profession has a wealth of weapons and relics to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game process contains multiple chapters, each chapter has various monsters and bosses waiting for players to challenge, and you can experience a variety of different adventure routes when playing repeatedly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/63e390c735ec430c2a536b428469e9f8.avif?t=1752552667\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Ember is a top-down Rogue-like action game in a dark fantasy style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the declining city of demi-humans on the edge of the world, you, as a well-trained demi-human warrior and the last hope of the tribe and the city-state, embark on an adventure to find and save the city-state and the tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.poster.avif?t=1752552667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.webm?t=1752552667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846790/extras/af6463045c2a97bb1d496e89fafa23e1.mp4?t=1752552667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players of different professions in the game will have completely different fighting styles, and each profession has a wealth of weapons and relics to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game process contains multiple chapters, each chapter has various monsters and bosses waiting for players to challenge, and you can experience a variety of different adventure routes when playing repeatedly.</p>",
